# Compact database (MFC-1022): the command in the Library menu's maintenance band. A fresh sample library has no free
# pages, so it answers that there's nothing worth giving back. Steps are described in docs/testing.md.
#   dotnet run --project src/MediaFileClassifier.Desktop -- --smoke tools/ui-smoke/compact-database.smoke --out artifacts/ui-smoke

window 1400x900
command view.theme-light
library sample

start library.compact-database
wait-for dialog
dialog-shot 01-nothing-to-reclaim
dialog-click Close
wait-for no-dialog
shot 02-after
